,'Checklist completion rate visible daily; misses escalated',2,'Checklist completion rate visible daily; misses escalated','HIGH','Operations','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Internal Process',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(7,'G07','Roasted & packed coffee sold at branches and supermarkets','Product live at all branches + supermarket accounts opened',3,'Product live at all branches + supermarket accounts opened','HIGH','Marketing / Import-Export','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(8,'G08','1 franchise store launched','First franchise location open and trading',37,'First franchise location open and trading','MEDIUM','DGM / Business Development','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(9,'G09','Kitchens removed from branches; fast-heating ovens installed; prep moved to production','All branch kitchens converted; central production supplying',2,'All branch kitchens converted; central production supplying','HIGH','Operations / Import / Production','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Internal Process',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(10,'G10','Soda discontinued; replaced with fizzy drinks','Soda phased out at all branches; fizzy drink line live',3,'Soda phased out at all branches; fizzy drink line live','MEDIUM','Marketing / Import / Operations','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(11,'G11','30+ gym partnerships with member discount card','30 gyms signed (~3 per month run-rate)',3,'30 gyms signed (~3 per month run-rate)','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(12,'G12','Coffee subscription program implemented','Subscription live with enrollment tracked monthly',3,'Subscription live with enrollment tracked monthly','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(13,'G13','Live on 3 delivery apps','Orders flowing from 3 apps',3,'Orders flowing from 3 apps','MEDIUM','Marketing / IT / Operations','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(14,'G14','40+ event partnerships (catering, booths)','40 events done (~4 per month run-rate)',3,'40 events done (~4 per month run-rate)','MEDIUM','Marketing / Operations','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(15,'G15','Bundle deals available at cafes (coffee + pastry)','Bundles on menu at all branches',3,'Bundles on menu at all branches','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(16,'G16','Loyalty program, customer database, birthday gift system solidified','System live; birthday gifts sending automatically',3,'System live; birthday gifts sending automatically','MEDIUM','Marketing / IT','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(17,'G17','Seasonal menus: rainy season, spring/new year, mango season','Each seasonal menu launched on time',3,'Each seasonal menu launched on time','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(18,'G18','4 strategic partnerships with trendy companies','4 partnerships signed (1 per quarter)',3,'4 partnerships signed (1 per quarter)','MEDIUM','Marketing','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Customer',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(19,'G19','Recipe on file for every menu item, approved and uploaded to CNET without error','100% menu coverage; zero recipe errors on CNET',36,'100% menu coverage; zero recipe errors on CNET','HIGH','F&B (Tseday) / Production','ACTIVE','2019 E.C.','Internal Process',1.72,1,'2026-10-24 12:58:29','2026-10-24 12:58:29'),(20,'G20','Cost % goal set per department (e.g., hot beverage 21-24%)','Targets published; tracked monthly on dashboard',36,'Targets published; tracked monthly on dashboard','MEDIUM','F&B (Tseday)','ACTI